{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"刚才的温柔还在，他却突然惊惧起来，像被一阵寒意猛地刺醒。\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"from\": [\"S06\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M18\", \"M22\", \"M25\", \"M30\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他刚学会不必逼亲近继续，也能珍惜它；可安静一断，这份安慰没能把亲近带回眼前。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [],\n      \"explains\": [],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M18\", \"M22\", \"M25\", \"M30\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"惊惧间，一股鲜活而熟悉的亲切感掠过，像日常细节忽然闪亮，却没有让他安定。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S03\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B5\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M1\", \"M7\", \"M8\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他曾真实尝到松开紧绷后轻快与亲近可以发生，所以那份活气能闪现，却不自动延续成安稳。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [],\n      \"explains\": [],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M1\", \"M7\", \"M8\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他不甘亲近就此退去，急切起初像要冲出去，后来却卡成翻转不停、屏息等待的紧张。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S05\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M20\", \"M23\", \"M27\", \"M32\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"S05已让他知道，急着延长亲近并不能使它继续，只会耗掉力气；这回冲出去的劲头也找不到出口。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [],\n      \"explains\": [],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M20\", \"M23\", \"M27\", \"M32\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"new\": [\n    \"他发现，能把亲近留作心里的安慰，并不等于安静被打断时就能平静承受；想把它留住的急切会回来，最后困成无出口的紧张。\"\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B4\",\n      \"why\": \"听感无法判定182–197是否确为先前宣告性材料的回归；即使材料相似，也不能据此推出他重新站稳或旧日自我恢复。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "dd98f954-d440-4d74-8f3c-224a365bba58", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T002205628631Z", "elapsed_seconds": 135.094, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T00:24:20.729966+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6d948e596855f7650d32b2fd4a33d5cdce8c426636528bb28044cd87a8ee9748", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T002205628631Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "113042ea24f4e0846ac9d52101693e79b00d45ef2ab7483c56faaa36e66e5df4"}}}
